Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:03.90,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There's only two WTA 1000 events{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还有两站{\fs78}WTA1000{\fs68}赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:05.56,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that Iga Swiatek has not won.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克仍未夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:09.52,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She reached the final of Dubai but still has yet to get a title,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在迪拜打进决赛 仍未夺冠
