Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:48.17,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}回到平分后 又化解第三个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:51.56,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}接下来 才是她自己的第一个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:05.66,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, Iga Swiatek able to hold off the advances of Ann Li,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克顶住安 李的冲击
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:07.92,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and the forehand holds up when it needs to.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N关键时刻 她的正手顶住了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:10.26,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Down the stretch, three break points saved{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N盘末挽救三个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:12.44,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and converts on her first set point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首个盘点便成功兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:14.52,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Iga Swiatek out in front,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克取得领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:17.24,TL,,0,0,620,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}one of the great front-runners in women's tennis,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她是女子网坛善打领先的高手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:20.20,TL,,0,0,620,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}has a one-set lead in Wuhan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在武汉先下一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.54,0:01:32.26,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Lest we forget, there's a little revenge on the mind of Iga Swiatek as well{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N别忘了 她也想报马德里之憾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.26,0:01:34.52,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for that Madrid performance where she had to beg out{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那场马德里比赛 她中途退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.52,0:01:37.24,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}at three-love in the third set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N当时决胜盘{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:53.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Looking to extinguish hope as she has the break and hold.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N破发再保发 要掐灭对手希望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.60,0:01:56.12,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's now eleven in the last twelve points,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最近{\fs78}12{\fs68}分 她拿下了{\fs78}11{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:58.26,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}since going back to the third break point she faced{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N从她面对第三个破发点算起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.26,0:02:00.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}when trying to serve for the opening set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那是首盘的发球胜盘局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.67,0:02:03.04,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} 这次看远端
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:04.72,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她沿着底线来回移动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:06.56,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}又把球连续打向两侧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:08.91,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}让对手一趟趟左右奔跑
