Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.93,0:02:20.90,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}之后 她连赢最后{\fs78}4{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:24.22,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}全场唯一的赛点 她没有错过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:31.58,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There's only two WTA 1000 events{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还有两站{\fs78}WTA1000{\fs68}赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:33.24,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that Iga Swiatek has not won.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克仍未夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.20,0:02:37.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She reached the final of Dubai but still has yet to get a title,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在迪拜打进决赛 仍未夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:41.52,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but she's never been to the semis before in Wuhan until now.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N武汉却是直到今天才首进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:46.54,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ann Li will achieve a new career-high ranking{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N安 李将刷新生涯最高排名
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:49.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she wakes up on Monday in the WTA Tour rankings,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就在周一的{\fs78}WTA{\fs68}世界排名中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:52.04,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but she will not find victory over Iga Swiatek{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N却没能再次击败斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:54.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for a second time this season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N本赛季没能再赢她一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.12,0:02:58.94,TL,,0,0,620,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as Iga Swiatek rolls through in straight sets,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克直落两盘过关
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:01.04,TL,,0,0,620,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}six-four, six-one,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:03.58,TL,,0,0,620,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and will face fellow Pole Maja Chwalinska in the semifinals.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N半决赛将对阵同胞赫瓦林斯卡
